return {
    ["%s俱乐部合并了%s俱乐部"] = "The %s Club merged with the %s Club.",
    ["%s等装备比较珍贵，是否继续分解？"] = "Equipment such as %s is quite precious. Continue to dismantle?",
    ["%s，好久不见：\n      我听说了你最近与西尔维娅艰辛的交战。辛苦了，你一直都很努力。我和苏茜搜集了一些有关西尔维娅的情报，希望能有所帮助：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302111\">西尔维娅的记载</>\n      你所承受的命运写满了未知与危险，连我们也无法勘破你身上的迷雾和谜团。未来或许还有更多的险境、更大的危机在等待着我们。我们都需要变得更强，才能保护好自己和珍视的事物。但当你疲惫的时候，欢迎随时来命运咖啡厅坐坐，我这里有不错的红茶和糕点，或许你会喜欢。闲暇的时候，可以来陪我和苏茜聊聊天，让心态平和下来，一切都会好起来的。\n      不用担心，我和其他人都会尽力帮助你，随信附上一些提升实力的建议。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s, long time no see: \n      I heard about your recent arduous battle with Sylvia. You've worked hard; you have always been very diligent. Susie and I have gathered some intelligence regarding Sylvia, and I hope it proves helpful: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302111\">Records of Sylvia</>\n      The fate you bear is filled with unknowns and dangers; even we cannot pierce through the mist and mysteries surrounding you. Perhaps more perilous situations and greater crises await us in the future. We all need to become stronger to protect ourselves and the things we cherish. But when you are exhausted, you are always welcome to come to the Fate Café for a seat. I have some excellent black tea and pastries here that you might enjoy. In your spare time, feel free to come chat with Susie and me to calm your mind; everything will be alright. \n      Do not worry; I and the others will do our best to help you. Attached to this letter are some suggestions for improving your strength. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-交易技巧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>在站点低价买入货物，在后续会收购该货物的站点高价卖出，赚取差价。\n<Assistant_Title2>判断价格：</>看到明显低于基础价的商品，可考虑买入；看到明显高于基础价的订购单，可优先卖出。每站可购买和可出售数量有限，受站点、货物倍率、区域倍率与协议加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>进阶建议：</>高难度路线更长，有时需要保留一定票券应对后续高价值机会。临近终点前，尽量把货物在高点卖出获取最大收益或确保折算价值足够冲评级。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Buy goods at a low price at a station and sell them at a high price at a subsequent station that acquires those goods to earn the price difference. \n<Assistant_Title2>Judging Prices: </>When you see goods significantly lower than the base price, consider buying; when you see purchase orders significantly higher than the base price, prioritize selling. The quantity that can be bought and sold at each station is limited, influenced by the station, goods multiplier, regional multiplier, and agreement bonuses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Advanced Advice: </>High-difficulty routes are longer, and sometimes you need to reserve a certain amount of tickets to deal with subsequent high-value opportunities. Before reaching the destination, try to sell goods at a high point to obtain maximum profit or ensure the converted value is sufficient to reach the rating.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>圣白薄纱・金丝刺绣・仪典礼服\n烈阳的光辉洒落，祈光者在晨祷中接受神圣的加冕。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Holy White Gauze · Gold Thread Embroidery · Ceremonial Gown \n The radiance of the Blazing Sun falls, and the Prayer-seeker receives a sacred coronation during morning prayer.",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎没有更多的线索了……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(There don't seem to be any more clues...)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（小声）</>{{PlayerName}}，逛得差不多了，我们去旁边聊聊吧。"] = "<P_Heart>(Whispering)</> {{PlayerName}}, we've looked around enough, let's go over there and talk.",
    ["<P_Heart>（巡视）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Patrol) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（恍惚）</>结束了，安迪也……"] = "<P_Heart>(Dazed)</> It's over, and Andy is also...",
    ["<P_Heart>（笑容满面）</>唱我儿子！我儿子哈维，考上霍伊大学了！是大学生！ "] = "<P_Heart> (Beaming) </> Singing about my son! My son Harvey, he got into Hoey University! He's a university student!",
    ["NPC-瓜摊老板2"] = "NPC-Melon Stall Owner 2",
    ["{{先生|小姐}}您好，我叫丽兹。欢迎光临！"] = "{{ Mr. | Ms. } }, hello, my name is Liz. Welcome!",
    ["“星星”（捏脸用）"] = "\"Star\" (for character customization)",
    ["　　书桌背后，一个戴着骷髅船长帽、脸色苍白的中年男子看着阿尔杰一步一步过来，愤怒地咬牙说道：\n        “我不会屈服的！”\n        “我相信你做得到。”阿尔杰平静地就像在说今天天气不太好。\n        “你……”中年男子一下怔住，似乎没预料到会是这样的回答。\n        就在这时，阿尔杰身体微弓，突然前冲，瞬间将两人的距离拉近到只剩书桌。\n        啪！\n        他肩膀一紧，右手猛地探出，捏住了中年男子的喉咙。\n        没给对方反应的机会，他手背浮现出片片虚幻鱼鳞，五指疯狂用力。\n\n        ——第一卷《小丑》第八章 新的时代"] = "Behind the desk, a middle-aged man wearing a skull captain's hat and a pale face watched Alger walk over step by step, saying through gritted teeth in anger:\n \"I will not submit!\"\n \"I believe you can do it.\" Alger was as calm as if he were saying the weather today wasn't very good.\n \"You...\" The middle-aged man was stunned, as if he hadn't expected such an answer.\n Just then, Alger's body arched slightly, and he suddenly lunged forward, instantly closing the distance between the two to just the desk.\n Slap!\n His shoulder tightened, and his right hand reached out violently, gripping the middle-aged man's throat.\n Without giving the opponent a chance to react, phantom fish scales appeared on the back of his hand, and his five fingers exerted crazy force.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 8: A New Era",
    ["　　克莱恩看着那很难说是一杯还是一块的深蓝色粘稠液体，艰难地吞了口唾沫道：\n　　“就这样喝下去？”\n　　“不需要另外的准备吗？比如仪式、咒文或者祈祷语？”\n　　老尼尔“呃”了一声道：\n　　“准备？有的，你先来杯因蒂斯的奥尔米尔葡萄酒，再抽上一根迪西雪茄，然后哼一节悠扬的旋律，跳一段轻快的宫廷舞，你喜欢踢踏舞也可以，最后再来局昆特牌……”\n　　见克莱恩的表情越来越呆愣，老尼尔笑了笑，给出前面描述的总结：\n　　“如果你感觉紧张。”\n　　……你还挺幽默嘛……克莱恩嘴角抽搐了两下，忍住了拔枪的冲动。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第三十四章 灵视"] = "Klein looked at the dark blue viscous liquid, which was hard to say if it was a cup or a block, and swallowed hard: \n \"Just drink it like this?\" \n \"Don't you need other preparations? Like rituals, incantations, or prayers?\" \n Old Neil went \"uh\" and said: \n \"Preparations? There are some. First, you have a cup of Intis Olmier wine, then smoke a Dicy cigar, then hum a melodious tune, dance a light court dance—you can do tap dance if you like—and finally, play a game of Gwent...\" \n Seeing Klein's expression becoming increasingly dazed, Old Neil smiled and gave a summary of the previous description: \n \"If you feel nervous.\" \n ...You're quite humorous... Klein's mouth twitched twice, and he resisted the urge to draw his gun. \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Clown\", Chapter 34, Spirit Vision",
